Package: mfvar
Type: Package
Title: Mixed Frequency VAR with Bayesian Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sam", "Bartlett", email = "sam@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements a Mixed Frequency VAR following Schorfheide and Song.
    The latent economy evolves monthly. Some variables are observed monthly, 
    others quarterly as averages of latent monthly log levels. Supports ragged 
    edge real-time forecasting, Bayesian estimation with Minnesota prior via 
    dummy observations, Gibbs sampling, prior selection by marginal data density, 
    and predictive distributions.
